msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What is it? Is there something on my＿face?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué pasa? ¿Tengo algo en la cara?」"

msgid "Taiga「......No, that's not it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......No, no es eso.」"

msgid "Taiga「Grr, what's with you? You really think＿the worst of me!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Grr, ¿qué te pasa? ¡De verdad＿piensas lo peor de mí!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, was I wrong?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ¿me equivoqué?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah, you're wrong! It's just...... I was＿just thinking that you're acting＿completely like yourself again, Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Sí, te equivocaste! Es solo que......＿pensaba que ya actúas otra vez＿totalmente como tú mismo, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, yeah, about that...... I'm going to＿stop depending on you, Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, sí, sobre eso...... Voy a dejar＿de depender de ti, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh? What did you just say?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh? ¿Qué acabas de decir?」"

msgid "Taiga「Ugh, listen to my every word when I'm＿speaking. I said I'm gonna become＿self-reliant.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Agh, escucha cada palabra que digo. Dije＿que voy a volverme autosuficiente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? What's going on all of a sudden?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿Y eso tan de repente?」"

msgid "Taiga「This isn't some random impulse or＿anything. I've been considering it for a＿long time, but I kept procrastinating.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No es un impulso repentino ni nada.＿Llevo mucho tiempo considerándolo,＿pero siempre lo postergaba.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But why? What's wrong with the way＿things are now?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Pero por qué? ¿Qué tienen de malo＿las cosas tal como están ahora?」"

msgid "Taiga「It's wrong for me and for you, Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Está mal para mí y para ti, Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「For me?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Para mí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I have no idea what you're talking＿about.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No tengo idea de qué estás hablando.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, no, just forget it. What's important＿is that I'm definitely missing＿something.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, no, olvídalo. Lo importante es＿que sin duda me hace falta algo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga......」"

msgid "Taiga「That's why I'm not going to rely on you.＿After today, I'm done with that＿dependent lifestyle.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Por eso no voy a depender de ti.＿Desde hoy, se acabó ese estilo＿de vida tan dependiente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Are you serious?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Hablas en serio?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yup.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sip.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Are you really going to live on your＿own?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿De verdad vas a valerte por ti misma?」"

msgid "Taiga「I said I'll be okay. Jeez, don't worry so＿much. You'll get ulcers that way.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Dije que estaré bien. Cielos, no te＿preocupes tanto. Te va a dar una úlcera.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But, I mean......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero, es que......」"

msgid "Taiga「Arrrgh, you're SO naggy! You give me＿no choice but to PROVE I can do just＿fine on my own.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Aaaagh, qué fastidioso eres! No＿me dejas más opción que DEMOSTRAR＿que puedo arreglármelas sola.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yes, for now, I'll help with the cooking.＿Come on, say the word.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí, por ahora ayudaré con la cocina.＿Anda, dime qué hacer.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hmmm, if you insist......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mmmm, si insistes......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Oh!? W-What's this feeling? I've got a＿slightly...... No, a REALLY bad feeling.＿An atrocious feeling!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡¿Eh?! ¿Q-Qué es esta sensación? Tengo＿un ligero...... No, ¡un presentimiento＿muy malo! ¡Un presentimiento atroz!）」"

msgid "Taiga「......Ryuuji?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Ryuuji?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, well, l-let's see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, bueno, v-veamos......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I don't want to crush her motivation,＿but...... but still...... Fuck, what do I do?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No quiero aplastar su motivación,＿pero...... aun así...... Mierda,＿¿qué hago?）」"

msgid "No, nothing comes to mind"
msgstr "No, no se me ocurre nada"

msgid "T-The dishes......"
msgstr "L-Los platos......"

msgid "F-Fried eggs, or boiled spinach......"
msgstr "H-Huevos fritos o espinaca hervida......"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, nothing comes to mind.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no se me ocurre nada.」"

msgid "Taiga「Huh? There's gotta be SOMETHING. I＿can make one little dish! Look, I can do＿the dishes!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Eh? Tiene que haber ALGO. ¡Puedo＿hacer un plato sencillo! ¡Mira,＿puedo lavar los platos!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Well, that's true...... How do I put＿this? I feel strangely uneasy.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「B-Bueno, eso es cierto...... ¿Cómo lo＿digo? Me siento extrañamente inquieto.」"

msgid "Taiga「Uneasy?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Inquieto?」"

msgid "Taiga「So you're saying you've decided letting＿me do something is too risky based on＿some vague memory?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Así que decidiste que dejarme hacer＿algo es demasiado arriesgado por culpa＿de un recuerdo borroso?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, well, err......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, bueno, ehm......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Eek!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Hii!」"

msgid "Taiga「J-Just...... pretend......」"
msgstr "Taiga「S-Solo...... finge......」"

msgid "Taiga「............Ngh.」"
msgstr "Taiga「............Ngh.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......T-Taiga?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿T-Taiga?」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't talk to me for a second! Let me＿think.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No me hables por un segundo!＿Déjame pensar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿E-Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「..................」"
msgstr "Taiga「..................」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（W-What's going on? What's the matter＿with Taiga......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Q-Qué está pasando? ¿Qué＿le ocurre a Taiga......?）」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ryuuji!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「I've made up my mind.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya tomé una decisión.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「About becoming independent?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Sobre volverte independiente?」"

msgid "Taiga「No! I mean, yeah, but that's a separate＿issue!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No! Bueno, sí, ¡pero＿ese es otro asunto!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then what is it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces, ¿qué es?」"

msgid "Taiga「Your memories. I'm going to get them＿all back for you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tus recuerdos. Voy a hacer＿que los recuperes todos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay...... Wait, what?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien...... Espera, ¿qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Did that really happen?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿De verdad pasó eso?」"

msgid "Taiga「Now I've decided to get you all those＿memories back. No more going easy on＿you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya decidí hacer que recuperes＿todos esos recuerdos. Se acabó＿ser blanda contigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「G-Going easy......? Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿S-Ser blanda......? ¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「Now that's decided, there's only one＿thing to do, Ryuuji!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ahora que está decidido, ¡solo queda＿una cosa por hacer, Ryuuji!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What are you getting me into?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿E-En qué me estás metiendo?」"

msgid "Taiga「Isn't it obvious? We're starting with＿food!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No es obvio? ¡Empezaremos＿por la comida!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ah, está bien!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then, t-the dishes......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces, l-los platos......」"

msgid "Taiga「The dishes? You got it!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Los platos? ¡Hecho!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Oh! D-Deja vu......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Ah! D-Deja vu......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Stop right there!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡A-Alto ahí!」"

msgid "Taiga「What?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well...... I seem to recall...... this exact＿situation......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno...... creo recordar......＿esta misma situación......」"

msgid "Taiga「Can you remember anything?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Logras recordar algo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What the...... In addition to the awful＿uneasiness from earlier......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero qué...... Además de esa terrible＿inquietud de hace rato......」"

msgid "Taiga「......What's wrong?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Qué ocurre?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's pretty vague, but...... I remember＿you standing in front of the sink......＿Shit, what happened!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es muy borroso, pero...... te recuerdo＿parada frente al fregadero......＿Mierda, ¡¿qué pasó?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait, let me calmly think it over...... This＿awful feeling...... The likely result...... Oh,＿a flood?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Espera, déjame pensarlo con calma......＿Esta mala sensación...... El resultado＿probable...... Oh, ¿una inundación?」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But just from dishes......? Oh, sorry,＿Taiga. Don't mind me. Carry on.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero ¿solo por los platos......? Ah,＿perdón, Taiga. No me hagas caso. Sigue.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Are you sure?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Estás seguro?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, I don't mind.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, no me importa.」"

msgid "Taiga「......There! All done!」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¡Listo! ¡Terminé!」"

msgid "Taiga「See? Look, Ryuuji! Didn't I do a great＿job?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Ves? ¡Mira, Ryuuji! ¿Verdad＿que hice un gran trabajo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, yeah...... You sure did.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, sí...... Claro que sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（ARRRRGH! How did she get water＿everywhere just from dishes......? Was＿this the root of my uneasiness?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡AAAAAGH! ¿Cómo salpicó agua por todas＿partes solo lavando platos......? ¿Era＿esto la raíz de mi inquietud?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Wait! Does that mean this same thing＿happened before......? Shit, I can't＿remember clearly!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Espera! ¿Eso quiere decir que esto＿ya pasó antes......? ¡Mierda, no logro＿recordarlo con claridad!）」"

msgid "Taiga「......What's wrong, Ryuuji?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Qué pasa, Ryuuji?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey Taiga...... Did something like this＿happen in the past?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, Taiga...... ¿Pasó algo＿como esto en el pasado?」"

msgid "Taiga「What? I've done the dishes and stuff＿before...... What about it?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué? Ya he lavado los platos y cosas＿así antes...... ¿Y qué con eso?」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, sorry. I'm okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, perdón. Estoy bien.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hey Ryuuji...... I've made up my mind.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oye, Ryuuji...... Ya me decidí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......About what?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Sobre qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「Your memories. I've decided I'm going＿to get them all back for you. Both the＿good ones and the not-so-good ones.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tus recuerdos. Decidí que voy a hacer＿que los recuperes todos. Tanto los＿buenos como los no tan buenos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Okay, but why are you being so＿formal about it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Está bien, ¿pero por qué＿te pones tan seria con eso?」"

msgid "Taiga「Up until now...... I was fine with you＿never remembering those not-so-good＿memories. But now......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Hasta ahora...... no me importaba que＿nunca recordaras esos recuerdos no＿tan buenos. Pero ahora......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Taiga「So I'm going to get them all back for＿you. No more going easy on you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Así que voy a devolvértelos todos.＿Se acabó ser blanda contigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「G-Going easy......? Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿S-Ser blanda......? ¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「Now that's decided, there's only one＿thing to do, Ryuuji!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ahora que está decidido, ¡solo queda＿una cosa por hacer, Ryuuji!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What are you getting me into?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿E-En qué me estás metiendo?」"

msgid "Taiga「Isn't it obvious? We're starting with＿food!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No es obvio? ¡Empezaremos＿por la comida!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ah, está bien!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「How about f-fried eggs, or boiled＿spinach......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué tal h-huevos fritos o＿espinaca hervida......?」"

msgid "Taiga「Sure, you got it! Fried eggs it is!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Claro, hecho! ¡Huevos fritos serán!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Ohh! What's this...... outrageous sense＿of danger!?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Ohh! ¡¿Qué es esta...... terrible＿sensación de peligro?!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Stop right there!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡A-Alto ahí!」"

msgid "Taiga「What?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「Alright, I don't mind, but...... Ryuuji,＿you're acting weird.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bien, no me importa, pero......＿Ryuuji, estás actuando raro.」"

msgid "Taiga「Nope. You're not the one who should＿be doing this.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Nop. Tú no eres quien debería＿estar haciendo esto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry, I'll let you handle it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón, te dejo encargarte a ti.」"

msgid "Taiga「Got it. So? What do I do next?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Entendido. ¿Y bien? ¿Qué hago ahora?」"

msgid "Taiga「So what you're saying is, I have to boil＿the water first, right?」"
msgstr "Taiga「O sea que primero tengo que＿hervir el agua, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You need that many steps!? There are＿pots under the sink, so use one of＿those.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Necesitas tantos pasos?! Hay＿ollas bajo el fregadero, así＿que usa una de esas.」"

msgid "Taiga「Will I need a lid for this?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Voy a necesitar una tapa para esto?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Doesn't really matter......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En realidad da igual......」"

msgid "Taiga「Nnn......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Mnn......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay, you don't need one for this! Put＿water in the pot, set it on the burner,＿and wait for it to boil.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Bien, para esto no hace falta! Pon＿agua en la olla, colócala en la hornilla＿y espera a que hierva.」"

msgid "Taiga「Then add the salt and the spinach......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Luego agrega la sal y la espinaca......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Once the stems are nice and tender,＿you're done. Move the pot into the sink＿and rinse them.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cuando los tallos estén bien tiernos,＿ya está. Lleva la olla al fregadero＿y enjuágalos.」"

msgid "Taiga「Got it. I'll follow those steps first. Go＿watch TV or something.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Entendido. Seguiré esos pasos primero.＿Ve a mirar la tele o algo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Are you sure?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Estás segura?」"

msgid "Taiga「I'll be fine. Leave it to me! If anything＿happens, I'll call you right away.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Estaré bien. ¡Déjamelo a mí! Si pasa＿cualquier cosa, te llamo enseguida.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien......」"

msgid "Taiga「......*Gasp*!」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¡Ah!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's the matter?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué sucede?」"

msgid "Taiga「It, it's nothing! Don't worry about it!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡N-No es nada! ¡No te preocupes!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I see......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y-Ya veo......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Is she really going to be okay......? I still＿feel a little uneasy......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿De verdad va a estar bien......? Sigo＿sintiéndome algo intranquilo......）」"

msgid "Taiga「Ouch!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ay!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ohh!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ohh!」"

msgid "Taiga「It's okay! Don't freak out over every＿little thing!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No pasa nada! ¡No te alarmes＿por cualquier tontería!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero......」"

msgid "Taiga「Enough! Just chill out!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Basta! ¡Cálmate ya!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Arrrgh, I'm gonna have a heart attack!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Aaaagh, me va a dar un infarto!）」"

msgid "Taiga「Annnd...... Done!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Yyy...... ¡Listo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, well done! Did you burn yourself?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Oh, bien hecho! ¿Te quemaste?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Correct. You seem to know what you're＿doing after all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Exacto. Parece que al final＿sí sabes lo que haces.」"

msgid "Taiga「I can do anything if I try hard. I just＿never try. Now then, how should I＿serve it～? Fufu♪」"
msgstr "Taiga「Puedo hacer lo que sea si me esfuerzo.＿Solo que nunca lo intento. Y bien,＿¿cómo lo sirvo～? Juju♪」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（She's even humming...... Oh?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Hasta está tarareando...... ¿Eh?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（T-This is...... the sugar jar. And it's＿almost half-- no, MORE than＿half-empty...... but why is it......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（E-Este es...... el frasco del azúcar.＿Y está casi medio-- no, MÁS de medio＿vacío...... pero ¿por qué está......?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（No, this is Taiga we're talking about......＿There's no doubt.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No, estamos hablando de Taiga......＿No hay duda alguna.）」"

msgid "Taiga「Hey Ryuuji, am I cutting it small＿enough?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oye, Ryuuji, ¿lo estoy cortando＿lo bastante pequeño?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, yeah, that's good......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, sí, así está bien......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What do I do......? Should I point it＿out......? But if I do......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Qué hago......? ¿Se lo digo......?＿Pero si lo hago......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Meanwhile, as I stood there＿conflicted......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Mientras tanto, yo me quedaba＿ahí indeciso......）」"

msgid "Yasuko「Goodness, did Taiga-chan make this＿for usss～?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Vaya! ¿Acaso Taiga-chan preparó＿esto para nosotrosss～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（It was time to eat......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Llegó la hora de comer......）」"

msgid "Taiga「Yup. Well, just the boiled spinach.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sip. Bueno, solo la espinaca hervida.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Still, well done! You're a good girl,＿Taiga-chan～ You'll make a good wife＿somedayyy.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Aun así, muy bien hecho! Eres una＿buena chica, Taiga-chan～ Serás una＿buena esposa algún díaaa.」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, I have a long way to go.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, aún me falta mucho.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Dammit, I should have said something＿sooner! Before Yasuko came home, at＿least!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Maldición, debí decir algo antes! ¡Al＿menos antes de que Yasuko volviera!）」"

msgid "Yasuko「So Ryuu-chan taught youuu. In that＿case, Ryuu-chan should have the first＿biteee.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Así que Ryuu-chan te enseñóoo.＿En ese caso, Ryuu-chan debería＿dar el primer bocadooo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh, yeah......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah, sí......」"

msgid "Taiga「Want soy sauce? Here.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Quieres salsa de soya? Toma.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Okay......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「E-Está bien......」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji, what do you say?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji, ¿qué se dice?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Thanks for the food......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Gracias por la comida......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Ngh!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......¡Ngh!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（UUURRRRRGGGGHHHH SWEET!＿Sweet, sweet, SWEET! I'm in sugary＿HELL! Tooth-rotting hell!!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡AAAARRRRGGGGHHH, QUÉ DULCE! ¡Dulce,＿dulce, DULCE! ¡Es un INFIERNO de azúcar!＿¡¡Para pudrir dientes!!）」"

msgid "Taiga「......What do you think?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Qué te parece?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh...... It's boiled, all right.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah...... Hervida sí que está.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Whew～ That's a relief.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Uf～ Qué alivio.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Look at that damn satisfied＿expression...... Goddammit! There's only＿one way out of this!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Mira esa maldita cara de＿satisfacción...... ¡Maldición!＿¡Solo hay una salida para esto!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey, can I eat the rest?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, ¿puedo comerme el resto?」"

msgid "Taiga「Huh? Why? What about me and＿Yacchan?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Eh? ¿Por qué? ¿Y qué hay＿de mí y de Yacchan?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Mercy! Good for you, Ryuu-channn.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Vaya! Qué bien por ti, Ryuu-channn.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Guess you really can do whatever you＿put your mind to...... Mph.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Supongo que en verdad puedes lograr＿lo que te propones...... Mph.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Ryuuji, let me have a little taste.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Ryuuji, déjame probar un poco.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No way. This is mine.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「De ninguna manera. Esto es mío.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji, you're sweating for some weird＿reason.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji, estás sudando por＿alguna extraña razón.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, seriously......? Aah!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ¿en serio......? ¡Aah!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's with you? Let go! Don't twist my＿arm!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué te pasa? ¡Suéltame! ¡No＿me tuerzas el brazo!」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut up! Gimme!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cállate! ¡Dame!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Goodness! Ufufu.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Cielos! Ufufu.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha--! Don't eat off my chopsticks!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Qu--! ¡¡No comas de mis palillos!!」"

msgid "Taiga「*Nom*......」"
msgstr "Taiga「*Ñam*......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Taiga「............Blegh.」"
msgstr "Taiga「............Puaj.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「T-Taiga......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿T-Taiga......?」"

msgid "Taiga「Bleh...... I, I saw hell. Ants were＿marching happily along.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Puaj...... V-Vi el infierno. Había＿hormigas marchando felices en fila.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh good, you're back with us!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Qué bien, regresaste con nosotros!」"

msgid "Yasuko「W-What just happened? You okay～?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Q-Qué acaba de pasar? ¿Estás bien～?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah...... I'm okay......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí...... estoy bien......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Wha--! Don't cry! It was an easy＿mistake for a beginner to make.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡Qu--! ¡No llores! Es un error＿fácil de cometer para un principiante.」"

msgid "Taiga「No, that isn't...... That's not it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No, no es...... No es por eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Sugar and salt?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿El azúcar y la sal?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah, at school.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí, en la escuela.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（At school......? What the? Now that she＿mentions it, I feel like there was......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿En la escuela......? ¿Qué? Ahora que＿lo menciona, siento que hubo......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......It's no use.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No sirve de nada.」"

msgid "Taiga「I see......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya veo......」"

msgid "Yasuko「Taiga-chan?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Taiga-chan?」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, uh, I'm okay. Thanks, Yacchan.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, eh, estoy bien. Gracias, Yacchan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry about this.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón por esto.」"

msgid "Taiga「You don't need to apologize, but...... but＿I've made up my mind, you know.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No tienes que disculparte, pero......＿pero ya tomé una decisión, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「About what? Becoming independent?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Sobre qué? ¿Volverte independiente?」"

msgid "Yasuko「W-Whaaat? Independence? What?＿Taiga-chan will be independent?＿Yacchan doesn't want thattt～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡¿Q-Quéee?! ¿Independencia? ¿Qué?＿¿Taiga-chan se va a independizar?＿¡Yacchan no quiere esooo～!」"

msgid "Taiga「Sorry, Yacchan. Let's save that＿conversation for later. I'm really sorry.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Perdón, Yacchan. Dejemos esa charla＿para después. De verdad lo siento.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Nnn, alright, yansuuu......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Mnn, está bien, yansuuu......」"

msgid "Taiga「I've made up my mind about your＿memories, Ryuuji. I've decided I'm＿going to get them all back for you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya tomé una decisión sobre tus＿recuerdos, Ryuuji. Decidí que voy＿a hacer que los recuperes todos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay...... Wait, what? Why are you＿being so formal?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien...... Espera, ¿qué?＿¿Por qué estás tan seria?」"

msgid "Taiga「Up until now...... For example, going＿back to our earlier conversation about＿mixing up sugar and salt......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Hasta ahora...... Por ejemplo, volviendo＿a lo que hablábamos antes sobre＿confundir el azúcar con la sal......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「G-Going easy......? Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿S-Ser blanda......? ¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「Now that's decided, there's only one＿thing to do, Ryuuji!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ahora que está decidido, ¡solo queda＿una cosa por hacer, Ryuuji!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What are you getting me into?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿E-En qué me estás metiendo?」"

msgid "Taiga「Isn't it obvious? We're starting with＿food. Thanks for the food!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No es obvio? Empezaremos por la＿comida. ¡Gracias por la comida!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wha...... What the hell......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qu...... ¿Qué demonios......?」"

msgid "Yasuko「C-Can Yacchan have some toooo?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Y-Yacchan también puede comerrrr?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, don't hesitate. Eat up.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, no te contengas. Adelante.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then are you so hungry you can't wait＿to eat? Sorry, but Yasuko will be home＿any time now, so wait just a little」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Tanta hambre tienes que no puedes＿esperar? Perdón, Yasuko vuelve en＿cualquier momento; espera un poco」"

msgid "Ryuuji「longer.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「más.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, I think I've gotten my domestic＿senses back completely. What a relief.＿Now you and Yasuko can continue to」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, creo que recuperé por completo＿mi instinto hogareño. Qué alivio. Ahora＿tú y Yasuko podrán seguir」"

msgid "Ryuuji「have decent lives.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「teniendo vidas decentes.」"

msgid "Taiga「You were hospitalized, and to make＿matters worse, you got amnesia...... But＿it seems you've got the hang of things」"
msgstr "Taiga「Estuviste hospitalizado y, para colmo,＿te dio amnesia...... Pero parece＿que ya dominas las cosas」"

msgid "Taiga「again, so I think now's my chance.」"
msgstr "Taiga「otra vez, así que creo que＿es mi oportunidad.」"

msgid "Taiga「Most likely...... No, without a doubt. I＿mean, we're supposed to think alike,＿but I can't help but think that there's a」"
msgstr "Taiga「Lo más seguro...... No, sin duda. Digo,＿se supone que pensamos igual, pero no＿puedo evitar pensar que hay」"

msgid "Taiga「little inconsistency.」"
msgstr "Taiga「una pequeña inconsistencia.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（So I said, but all that's left is the＿dishes...... Come to think of it, there's＿mustard spinach in the fridge. It could）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Eso dije, pero solo falta lavar los＿platos...... Pensándolo bien, hay＿espinaca mostaza en el refrigerador. Se）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（be boiled...... No, maybe fried eggs＿would be easier......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（podría hervir...... No, tal＿vez unos huevos fritos serían＿más fáciles......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't understand it myself, but it's＿like deja vu from a previous＿spectacular disaster...... Never mind,」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ni yo mismo lo entiendo, pero es como＿un deja vu de un desastre espectacular＿del pasado...... Olvídalo,」"

msgid "Ryuuji「maybe not.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「tal vez no.」"

msgid "Taiga「Yes, yes, we all know I'm a klutz, isn't＿that right? But you know, I think I'll＿just pretend I didn't hear that arbitrary」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí, sí, todos sabemos que soy torpe,＿¿no? Pero ¿sabes?, creo que fingiré＿que no oí esa arbitraria」"

msgid "Taiga「condemnation......」"
msgstr "Taiga「condena......」"

msgid "Taiga「For example...... I think that weird＿uneasy feeling you had earlier＿probably came from an earlier memory」"
msgstr "Taiga「Por ejemplo...... Creo que esa extraña＿inquietud que sentiste antes seguro＿vino de un recuerdo anterior」"

msgid "Taiga「of when I nearly set your house on fire＿trying to help you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「de cuando casi incendio tu casa＿tratando de ayudarte.」"

msgid "Taiga「It really did. I thought since it was＿embarrassing for me, and traumatic＿for you, you'd be better off never」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí pasó. Pensé que, como era vergonzoso＿para mí y traumático para ti, sería＿mejor que nunca lo」"

msgid "Taiga「remembering. Until now.」"
msgstr "Taiga「recordaras. Hasta ahora.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hmm...... Well, bits and pieces of a＿scene come to mind, but the memory＿itself...... I have an outline, but the」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mmm...... Bueno, me vienen a la mente＿retazos de una escena, pero el recuerdo＿en sí...... Tengo la base, pero los」"

msgid "Ryuuji「crucial details aren't there at all......＿Fuck.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「detalles cruciales no están por＿ningún lado...... Mierda.」"

msgid "Taiga「I realized that for your true memory to＿start to come together, you would＿need those ones too. Even the boring」"
msgstr "Taiga「Me di cuenta de que para reconstruir＿tus verdaderos recuerdos, también＿necesitas esos. Hasta los sucesos」"

msgid "Taiga「events are probably necessary.」"
msgstr "Taiga「aburridos seguro son necesarios.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（That's it...... I remember now! Last time＿Taiga tried to make fried eggs, she＿nearly burned my house down! That's）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Eso es...... ¡Ya lo recuerdo! ¡La vez＿pasada Taiga quiso hacer huevos fritos＿y casi quema mi casa! ¡Por eso es）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（why I've been feeling so uneasy!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（que me sentía tan intranquilo!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「T-Taiga, on second thought, let's go＿with the spinach! There's some in the＿fridge, and we need to use it before it」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「T-Taiga, pensándolo mejor, ¡hagamos la＿espinaca! Hay en el refrigerador y＿tenemos que usarla antes de que se」"

msgid "Ryuuji「spoils. Yep, let's do that!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「eche a perder. ¡Sí, hagamos eso!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, no I'm not! Here's the spinach.＿First you rinse it off, then cut off the＿roots, but don't cut off too much...... Oh,」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No, claro que no! Toma la espinaca.＿Primero la enjuagas y cortas la raíz,＿pero no cortes demasiado...... Ah,」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I shouldn't do it, should I?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「no debería hacerlo yo, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? What do you do next? All that's＿left is to boil it in salt water...... Oh yeah.＿When you go to put it in the hot water,」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿Qué sigue después? Solo falta＿hervirla en agua con sal...... Ah, sí.＿Cuando vayas a meterla al agua caliente,」"

msgid "Ryuuji「hold it by the leaf and let the stem＿soak for a while.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「sujétala por la hoja y deja el＿tallo remojándose un rato.」"

msgid "Taiga「It's nothing you should concern＿yourself with. So now what......? No,＿wait, uhh...... I drain it and cut it into」"
msgstr "Taiga「No es algo de lo que debas preocuparte.＿¿Y ahora qué......? No, espera, eh......＿La escurro y la corto en」"

msgid "Taiga「bite-sized pieces, right?」"
msgstr "Taiga「trozos pequeños, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, I mean, there are other side＿dishes, and eating your cooking for the＿first time...... yup, it's great! It's」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, digo, hay otros acompañamientos,＿y probar tu comida por primera vez......＿¡sip, está genial! ¡Está」"

msgid "Ryuuji「delicious, Taiga!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「deliciosa, Taiga!」"

msgid "Taiga「Hey Ryuuji, something like this＿happened in the past...... Umm, can you＿remember...... another time when sugar」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oye, Ryuuji, algo así pasó en el＿pasado...... Ehm, ¿puedes recordar......＿otra vez en que el azúcar」"

msgid "Taiga「and salt were switched?」"
msgstr "Taiga「y la sal se confundieron?」"

msgid "Taiga「To me...... Well, I thought since it was＿embarrassing for me, and hardly＿important to you, you'd be better off」"
msgstr "Taiga「Para mí...... Bueno, pensé que como era＿vergonzoso para mí y casi sin＿importancia para ti, sería mejor que」"

msgid "Taiga「never remembering. Until now.」"
msgstr "Taiga「nunca lo recordaras. Hasta ahora.」"

msgid "Taiga「But now I've decided to get all your＿memories back. The good ones, the＿painful ones, and the meaningless」"
msgstr "Taiga「Pero ahora decidí hacer que recuperes＿todos tus recuerdos. Los buenos, los＿dolorosos y también los que no tienen」"

msgid "Taiga「ones too. No more going easy on you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「sentido. Ya no seré blanda contigo.」"
